      <div className="page-enter"><div className="eyebrow mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-accent"><span className="size-2 rounded-full bg-accent" />A private introduction to something meaningful</div><h1 className="max-w-2xl font-display text-[clamp(3.6rem,8vw,7.6rem)] leading-[.87] tracking-[-.045em] text-primary">For a life<br /><em className="text-accent">well rooted.</em></h1><p className="mt-8 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground">Pahadi Bwari is a respectful matrimonial space for adults from the Uttarakhand community — built around intention, not endless scrolling.</p><div className="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><Link href="/sign-up" className="focus-ring inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-accent px-5 text-sm font-bold text-accent-foreground shadow-lg shadow-accent/15" data-testid="link-hero-join">Create your profile <ArrowRight size={17} /></Link><Link href="/how-it-works" className="focus-ring inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-5 text-sm font-semibold hover:border-primary/40" data-testid="link-hero-how">See how it works</Link></div><div className="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ShieldCheck size={16} className="text-primary" /> Your contact details stay private by default</div></div>
